Noctora OS settings
===================

Boot to a normal login screen instead of straight into the TV interface:
  sudo touch /etc/noctora/no-autologin
  sudo rm -f /etc/plasmalogin.conf.d/50-noctora-autologin.conf /etc/sddm.conf.d/50-noctora-autologin.conf

Re-run first-boot app installation:
  sudo rm /var/lib/noctora/apps-installed && sudo systemctl start noctora-firstboot-apps
